# Azure Tenant Switcher mappings
#
# Format: alias|tenant-id|display label
# - alias: letters, numbers, underscores, and hyphens; it must begin with a
#   letter or number.
# - tenant-id: Azure Entra tenant UUID.
# - display label: a non-empty printable label shown in shell output and the
#   optional prompt tag.
#
# Copy this file to the user-local path documented in README.md before adding
# real tenant IDs. Do not commit that local copy.
contoso|11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555555|Contoso Engineering
fabrikam|22222222-3333-4444-8555-666666666666|Fabrikam Research
northwind|33333333-4444-4555-8666-777777777777|Northwind Retail
